    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ancient times, there was a great war between the Dragon and Phoenix tribes! So the strongest expert representing the Phoenix tribe and the strongest expert representing the Dragon tribe engaged in a martial arts competition! What will be the result? To be continued~~~~<br>Player 1: Use the WSAD key to control movement, double-click the directional keys to run, use the J key to attack, use the K key to jump, use the L key to defend and restore magic, and use the UIO key for special skill attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2: Use the directional keys to control movement, double-click the directional keys to run, use the 1 key to attack, use the 2 key to jump, use the 3 key to defend and restore magic, and use the 456 key for special skill attacks <br>&quot;Dragon and Phoenix&quot; is a magnificent action fighting game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regarding this game, double clicking on the directional building allows for running and jumping attacks! The impact of this game is very strong! <br>Hope: I hope you enjoy this game, and I hope you can find joy in it!</p>",
